message: "If you reference these tools or projects, please cite this repository."
title: "Vino (vino3dx) - CG Generalist and Technical Artist: profile and project index"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vino
    alias: vino3dx
    website: "https://vinofx.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vino3dx/vino3dx"
url: "https://vinofx.com/"
abstract: >-
  Vino (vino3dx) is a CG generalist and technical artist working on real-time
  graphics, game engine tooling, shaders, VFX, DCC automation and AI-assisted
  development workflows. This repository indexes verified public projects,
  including MCP servers for Autodesk 3ds Max and Godot, automation toolkits for
  3ds Max and Blender, Godot utility and licensing tools, and offline computer
  vision components for game engines.
